{
  "id": "extras/realtime",
  "title": "Realtime",
  "description": "WebSockets: a Realtime service, a hibernating Room Durable Object, a useRoom hook and a demo on /app.",
  "files": [
    {
      "path": "files/core-realtime.ts",
      "target": "packages/core/src/realtime.ts"
    },
    {
      "path": "files/Room.ts",
      "target": "apps/web/src/realtime/Room.ts"
    },
    {
      "path": "files/realtime.ts",
      "target": "apps/web/src/server/realtime.ts"
    },
    {
      "path": "files/realtime-route.ts",
      "target": "apps/web/src/server/realtime-route.ts"
    },
    {
      "path": "files/use-room.ts",
      "target": "apps/web/src/lib/use-room.ts"
    },
    {
      "path": "files/realtime-demo.tsx",
      "target": "apps/web/src/components/realtime-demo.tsx"
    },
    {
      "path": "files/realtime-limits.ts",
      "target": "packages/core/src/realtime-limits.ts"
    },
    {
      "path": "files/realtime-limits.test.ts",
      "target": "packages/core/test/realtime-limits.test.ts"
    }
  ],
  "dependencies": {},
  "devDependencies": {},
  "envVars": [],
  "requires": [],
  "conflicts": [],
  "guide": {
    "purpose": "WebSocket rooms. Each room is a Durable Object (`Room`) that hibernates while idle. On the server, the `Realtime` service connects clients, broadcasts to a room and counts its connections; in the UI, the `useRoom` hook joins a room.",
    "service": {
      "name": "Realtime",
      "file": "packages/core/src/realtime.ts",
      "errors": [
        "RealtimeError"
      ]
    }
  },
  "transforms": [
    {
      "name": "addExport",
      "args": {
        "file": "packages/core/src/index.ts",
        "export": "*",
        "from": "./realtime"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "addExport",
      "args": {
        "file": "apps/web/src/server.ts",
        "export": "Room",
        "from": "./realtime/Room"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "addLayer",
      "args": {
        "file": "apps/web/src/server/layers.ts",
        "import": "RealtimeLive",
        "from": "./realtime",
        "layer": "RealtimeLive"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "addArrayItem",
      "args": {
        "file": "apps/web/src/server/routes.ts",
        "name": "workerRoutes",
        "item": "realtimeRoute",
        "import": "realtimeRoute",
        "from": "./realtime-route"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "addArrayItem",
      "args": {
        "file": "apps/web/src/components/widgets.tsx",
        "name": "widgets",
        "item": "<RealtimeDemo key=\"realtime\" />",
        "import": "RealtimeDemo",
        "from": "./realtime-demo"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "addWranglerBinding",
      "args": {
        "key": "durable_objects.bindings",
        "value": "{\"name\":\"ROOM\",\"class_name\":\"Room\"}"
      },
      "when": {
        "infra": [
          "none"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "addWranglerBinding",
      "args": {
        "key": "migrations",
        "value": "{\"tag\":\"realtime-v1\",\"new_sqlite_classes\":[\"Room\"]}"
      },
      "when": {
        "infra": [
          "none"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "addAlchemyResource",
      "args": {
        "name": "room",
        "code": "const room = Cloudflare.DurableObject(\"Room\")",
        "binding": "ROOM"
      },
      "when": {
        "infra": [
          "alchemy"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "appendAgentsSection",
      "args": {
        "id": "realtime",
        "content": "## Realtime\n\n- Rooms are a Durable Object (`Room`, exported from `apps/web/src/server.ts`); WebSocket upgrades are handled by a Worker route in `server/routes.ts`.\n- Use the `Realtime` service from `@repo/core` on the server and the `useRoom` hook in `apps/web/src/lib/use-room.ts` in the UI.\n- Keep message payloads small and validate incoming messages with `Schema` before using them."
      }
    }
  ]
}
